====================================================================
39. ORIGIN PROTOCOL POLICY
====================================================================

Origin Protocol Policy controls how CloudFront
connects to the origin.


For a custom origin such as ALB, options include:

    HTTP Only

    HTTPS Only

    Match Viewer


Examples:

    Viewer -> HTTPS
    CloudFront -> HTTPS
    ALB


or:

    Viewer -> HTTPS
    CloudFront -> HTTP
    ALB


For secure production architecture, HTTPS between
CloudFront and ALB is generally preferred when the
