14. WHEN TO USE PaaS?
=====================

Use PaaS when:

```
- Developers should focus on application code
- Infrastructure management should be reduced
- Fast deployment is important
- Application uses a supported runtime
- You don't need OS-level control
```

Example:

```
"I have a Python application and I don't want to manage
