31. WHEN SHOULD A COMPANY CHOOSE PaaS?
======================================

Choose PaaS when:

```
- Application development is the priority
- Server management should be minimized
- Fast deployment is important
- Standard runtimes are sufficient
- OS-level customization is not required
```

Question:

```
"Do I mainly want to deploy my code?"
```

If YES:

```
PaaS may be appropriate.
```

====================================================================
32. WHEN SHOULD A COMPANY CHOOSE SaaS?
======================================

Choose SaaS when:

